<bblocks://ogc.sosa.features.samplingCollection> a skos:Concept,
        dcat:Dataset,
        bblocks:BBlock,
        bblocks:Schema ;
    rdfs:label "SamplingCollection Feature" ;
    dct:abstract "OMS alignment: `sosa:SamplingCollection` is a SOSA/SSN generalization with no direct ISO 19156 (OMS) counterpart; OMS defines no dedicated sampling-collection requirement class. See the OMS alignment building block (`ogc.sosa.oms-alignment`). This building block defines the set of a GeoJSON FeatureCollection containing a SOSA SamplingCollection - a collection of one or more Samplings, whose members share a common value for one or more properties."^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
