    dct:abstract "Documents, class by class, how the SOSA-based building blocks in this register realize the ISO 19156:2023 Observations, Measurements and Samples (OMS) conceptual model, and identifies which building blocks are SOSA/SSN generalizations with no direct OMS counterpart."^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
