    bblocks:status <http://www.opengis.net/def/status/under-development> ;
    bblocks:validationPassed true .

<bblocks://ogc.sosa.properties.observation> a skos:Concept,
        dcat:Dataset,
        bblocks:BBlock,
        bblocks:Schema ;
    rdfs:label "Observation Properties" ;
    dct:abstract "OMS alignment: implements the ISO 19156:2023 (OGC Topic 20 / O&M 3.0) `obs-cpt/Observation` requirement class for `sosa:Observation`. This building block defines the set of properties for an observation according to the SOSA/SSN specification. These properties may be directly included into a root element of a JSON object or used in the properties container of a GeoJSON feature."^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
